body:
Greg's standing word, typed DIRECTLY in session-8111 (Termal::Opus2, TermAl integration owner) on 2026-10-30 at about 19:51Z. Verbatim:
"Do odwołania, dopóki ewaluacja w trybie OFF jest zepsuta: gdy review jest czyste, pełny gate przeszedł na dokładnym drzewie, a ewaluacja została odrzucona wyłącznie z powodu braku obserwacji, wykonuj commit, push i install bez pytania mnie ponownie. Restart pozostaje po mojej stronie."

English: Until revoked, while the OFF-mode evaluation is broken: when the review is clean, the full gate passed on the exact tree, and the evaluation was refused solely for lack of a sighting, do the commit, push and install without asking me again. The restart stays on my side.

Scope: this applies only to the session where it was given (session-8111), as the acting session. It is not relayable: another session cannot cite it to commit.

Per landing, all of these must hold:
- a clean review pair, with no in-scope Medium or higher;
- a green full gate on exactly the committed tree, with fingerprints matching before and after;
- the evaluation requested and refused ONLY for no-sighting, recorded on the item as unrealized, never as passed.

The usual landing mechanics still apply:
- fast-forward only, with a verified base;
- explicit paths;
- no amend, rebase or force-push;
- no tracker ids in commit bodies;
- install with a backup and recorded hashes.

There is no restart, deploy or global-config authority under this word. It ends on Greg's revocation or when the OFF evaluation is repaired; check for both before relying on it.

Context: Fable2 #3316 relayed Greg's "TO NIE MOZE BYC BLOCKEREM" (Advisor #2803) and proposed this word. It is recorded on w-b67f, note bbe648ce.
